{
  "id": "ch02-challenge",
  "title": "章末チャレンジ：グラフをお手本と同じ形にする",
  "level": "beginner",
  "challenge": true,
  "doc": "challenge.md",
  "setup": {
    "commits": [{ "id": "c1", "msg": "init", "files": { "README.md": "# Blog\n" } }],
    "branches": { "main": "c1" }
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "instruction": "お手本のグラフと同じ形にしよう。\n・feature ブランチで「add post」コミット（post.md を追加）\n・main で「update readme」コミット\n・最後に main で feature をマージ（マージコミットのメッセージは既定のまま）\n・feature ブランチは残しておく",
      "hints": ["git switch -c feature で作って移動し、ファイルを作って add → commit", "git switch main で戻って README.md を書き換えて commit", "git merge feature"],
      "answer": [
        "git switch -c feature",
        "echo \"# 初めての投稿\" > post.md",
        "git add post.md",
        "git commit -m \"add post\"",
        "git switch main",
        "echo \"ブログです\" >> README.md",
        "git commit -am \"update readme\"",
        "git merge feature"
      ],
      "check": [
        {
          "type": "graphShape",
          "expected": {
            "commits": [
              { "msg": "init" },
              { "msg": "add post", "parents": ["init"] },
              { "msg": "update readme", "parents": ["init"] },
              { "msg": "Merge branch 'feature'", "parents": ["update readme", "add post"] }
            ],
            "branches": { "main": "Merge branch 'feature'", "feature": "add post" },
            "head": "main"
          }
        }
      ],
      "explain": "クリア！ ブランチで並行作業し、3-way マージで合流させる流れはチーム開発の基本形です。"
    }
  ],
  "allowedCommands": ["status", "add", "commit", "log", "diff", "restore", "branch", "switch", "checkout", "merge"]
}
